[{"title":"月下弹琴记集句诗二十首 其二十","author":"李桢","text":"门前不改旧山河，莲渚愁红荡碧波。\n坠叶飘花难再复，浮云流水竟如何。\n鱼龙寂寞秋江冷，鸿雁不来风雨多。\n穷巷悄然车马绝，磬声深夏出烟萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6432,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"放歌用少白韵","author":"陈言","text":"一百五日又欲来，千树万树梨花开。\n眼看春色如流水，人生相命亦如此。\n百年三万六千朝，倏忽须臾难久恃。\n君不见十八羽林郎，君王手赐黄金铛。\n日晚朝回拥宾从，片言出口生辉光。\n一朝负遣辞丹阙，穷巷悄然车马绝。\n舞影歌声散绿池，遗垆但见狐狸迹。\n当时一旦擅豪华，见此空为人所嗟。\n莫向尊前惜沉醉，参差辜负东园花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6433,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过坤上人居","author":"陈言","text":"野寺夕阳边，香床坐入禅。\n龙宫连栋宇，世界接人天。\n宝叶交香雨，鲜云抱石莲。\n浮名竟何益，心赏独泠然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6434,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折杨柳","author":"陈言","text":"袅袅城边柳，相思几度攀。\n不颦复不语，长望独长叹。\n露叶凝愁黛，垂条拂髻鬟。\n落花相与恨，不断若连环。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6435,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜江楼闻笛","author":"陈言","text":"楼前澹月连江白，楼底谁家吹玉笛？\n笛声愤怨哀中流，一夜愁杀江南客。\n江南万里不归家，空掩柴扉度岁华。\n双泪别来犹未断，那堪又听《落梅花》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6436,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张应鹤郊居","author":"陈言","text":"曲径幽人宅，藩篱插槿齐。\n裁衣延野客，分食养山鸡。\n古木生云际，回塘绕郭西。\n寂寥人境外，何事武陵溪？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6437,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞曲赠林参军","author":"陈言","text":"入幕推英选，论兵迈古风。\n卷旗收败马，锵佩揖群公。\n紫塞金河里，天山弱水东。\n晚风吹画角，残日让雕弓。\n庙略占黄气，精神贯白虹。\n丈夫期报主，看取宝刀雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6438,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"携歌者访方氏不遇","author":"陈言","text":"白日移歌袖，空斋不见君。\n岩声中谷应，人语隔溪闻。\n断壁分垂影，回沙拥籀文。\n无人知所去，红叶下纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6439,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中寓秦溪","author":"陈言","text":"病多慵引架书看，双袖龙钟泪不干。\n世态炎凉随节序，人情反覆似波澜。\n溪风送雨过秋寺，山鸟将雏傍药栏。\n同学少年多不贱，独将衰鬓客秦关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6440,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题天台图寄怀林介夫","author":"陈言","text":"锦瑟惊弦破梦频，无因重见玉楼人。\n鸟啼云窦仙岩静，梦入天台石路新。\n芍药比容花比貌，暖烟如粉草如茵。\n人间只道三山远，犹隔千山与万津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6441,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兵后高邮道中寄怀郑平山冂，丞","author":"陈言","text":"自怜羁客尚飘蓬，故国荆扉在梦中。\n笛怨柳营烟漠漠，马嘶山店雨蒙蒙。\n风尘荏苒音书绝，人物萧条市井空。\n珍重仙曹旧知己，不知闲醉与谁同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6442,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感旧","author":"陈言","text":"歧路三秋别，悠悠关复河。\n今来数行泪，泉下故人多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6443,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋落叶送别","author":"陈言","text":"落叶乱纷纷，林间起送君。\n还愁独宿夜，孤客最先闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6444,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳曲 其一","author":"陈言","text":"鬓云斜亸凤钗横，偷折花枝傍水行。\n更有恼人肠断处，慢回娇眼笑盈盈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6445,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳曲 其二","author":"陈言","text":"金凤钗头逐步摇，花如双脸柳如腰。\n最怜长袖风前弱，拽住仙郎尽放娇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6446,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳曲 其三","author":"陈言","text":"金铺闲掩绣帘低，轻打银筝坠燕泥。\n忆昔花间初识面，倚屏无语捻云篦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6447,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳曲 其四","author":"陈言","text":"轻鬓丛梳阔画眉，翠翘浮动玉钗垂。\n醉来咬损新花子，绕树藏身打雀儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6448,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观丽人走马","author":"陈言","text":"玉鞍初跨柳腰柔，娇眼如波入鬓流。\n翠袂半将遮粉臆，掉鞭横过小江楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6449,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上金山寺集元句","author":"陈言","text":"神鳌屹立戴崔巍，此地曾经几劫灰。\n宝藏虎归风撼树，碧潭龙去水生苔。\n云移塔影横江口，船载钟声出浪堆。\n独倚阑干飞鸟外，不知身世是蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6450,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人入蜀以下集明句","author":"陈言","text":"岧峣高阁倚岩阿，把酒相看奈别何。\n寒色渐经巴峡路，雨声微长楚江波。\n沧洲别业惊蓬断，白发流年倚剑过。\n他日相逢又何处，眼中知己渐无多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6451,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吊岳坟用壁间韵","author":"陈言","text":"金牌十二诏班师，痛饮黄龙愿竟违。\n万里銮舆终北狩，千年松柏尚南枝。\n雨荒孤冢埋金剑，云锁空山暗铁衣。\n莫向此中多感慨，五陵衰草正离离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6452,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春思","author":"陈言","text":"珠箔上银钩，春花压翠楼。\n笙歌何处响，鹦鹉对人愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6453,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈三亦入越用韦庄韵","author":"陈言","text":"野花藤蔓乱毵毵，送别旗亭酒半酣。\n十丈画船如画阁，载将春色到江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6454,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"陈言","text":"宝凤搔头玉步摇，艳妆空似海棠娇。\n春情一种无聊赖，重到桃花第四桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6455,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉士女","author":"陈言","text":"寂寂无言敛翠蛾，花阴试步学凌波。\n玉颜空有嫦娥貌，不及芭蕉雨露多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6456,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏赠莲如美人","author":"陈言","text":"玉缨翠佩杂轻罗，眉映春山眼映波。\n折得白莲头上插，问人潇洒似谁么。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6457,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟行即景","author":"陈言","text":"红帘小艇稳如车，寒水娟娟浸白沙。\n汀畔数鸥闲不起，见人飞去入芦花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6458,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花集句四首 其一","author":"童琥","text":"竹外松边一两稍，迥临村落傍溪桥。\n堪将乱蕊添云肆，苦被芳风透绮寮。\n春事顿随花片薄，清吟半逐梦魂销。\n却思前载孤山下，踏雪相寻岂惮遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6459,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花集句四首 其二","author":"童琥","text":"练裙缟袂雪精神，梦在罗浮江上村。\n竹屋纸窗清不俗，风台月观悄无言。\n笑拈霜管题诗句，静爱寒香扑酒尊。\n谁遣胡儿吹塞笛，分明哀怨曲中论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6460,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花集句四首 其三","author":"童琥","text":"残雪疏篱半欲摧，暗香消息巳传梅。\n三家五家村舍出，一花两花香意回。\n今日多情惟我到，无人解惜为谁开。\n相逢剩作尊前恨，何处笛声江上来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6461,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花集句四首 其四","author":"童琥","text":"偶泄春光此一枝，故山幽梦忆疏篱。\n雪羞洁白常回避，风近清香似可期。\n老气却因高树得，闲愁只许落花知。\n醉中曾记吟诗处，独倚阑干待月时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6462,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花集句二首 其一","author":"童琥","text":"一枝梅笑破冬严，残腊新春气候参。\n更被谁家多事笛，不教幽梦到江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6463,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花集句二首 其二","author":"童琥","text":"江南地暖陇西寒，一种春风有两般。\n最爱夜深霜重处，无人起向月中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6464,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情集句四首 其一","author":"刘芳节","text":"绿惨双蛾不自持，晓庭和露折残枝。\n长疑好事皆虚事，莫遣佳期竟后期。\n旧曲听来犹有恨，柔肠结尽转相思。\n遥知更有难忘处，射雉春风得意时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6465,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情集句四首 其二","author":"刘芳节","text":"纤纤初月上鸦黄，不把双眉斗画长。\n素柰忽开西子面，芙蓉不及美人妆。\n对题锦字添新恨，闲对幽花识旧香。\n欲说春心无所似，池边顾步两鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6466,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情集句四首 其三","author":"刘芳节","text":"劈破云鬟金凤凰，梦回馀念属潇湘。\n徒劳掩袂伤铅粉，但惜流尘暗洞房。\n两脸酒曛红杏妒，一丛高髻绿云光。\n妆成只是熏香坐，欲卷珠帘春恨长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6467,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情集句四首 其四","author":"刘芳节","text":"旧事凄凉不可听，含红怨绿影亭亭。\n琴声断续愁兼恨，杯酒留连醉复醒。\n新睡起来思旧梦，夜香烧罢掩重扃。\n绿窗璧月移花影，银烛秋光冷画屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6468,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼长孺集句四首 其一","author":"丘刘","text":"江流曲似九回肠，愁思非春亦自伤。\n明月不知人世变，夜来依旧下西厢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6469,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼长孺集句四首 其二","author":"丘刘","text":"莺声不散柳含烟，寒食家家送纸钱。\n心折此时无一寸，杏花零落寺门前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6470,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼长孺集句四首 其三","author":"丘刘","text":"磬声初尽漏声长，添得离人两鬓霜。\n阶下青苔与红叶，九原何处不心伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6471,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼长孺集句四首 其四","author":"丘刘","text":"窗残夜月人何在，一见清明一改容。\n坠叶飘花难再复，生离死别恨无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6472,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追怀亡兄金吾延伯歌姬散尽有感集句 其一","author":"丘刘","text":"残花怅望近人开，南国佳人去不回。\n回首可怜歌舞地，年年春色为谁来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6473,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追怀亡兄金吾延伯歌姬散尽有感集句 其二","author":"丘刘","text":"湿云如梦雨如尘，自有春愁正断魂。\n人面不知何处在，空留莺语到黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6474,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追怀亡兄金吾延伯歌姬散尽有感集句 其三","author":"丘刘","text":"千山万水玉人遥，人事音书谩寂寥。\n惆怅一年春又去，更无消息到今朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6475,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追怀亡兄金吾延伯歌姬散尽有感集句 其四","author":"丘刘","text":"谁家玉笛暗飞声，总是乡关离别情。\n妾梦不离江上水，夜来还到洛阳城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6476,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶作","author":"徐仙","text":"静里乾坤不计春，非非是是任纷纷。\n醒原醉白今何在，云外青山山外云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6477,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"霍山岩壁仙诗","author":"无名氏","text":"八表烟霞总一家，蓝桥到此作生涯。\n人间富贵尘如海，虚度春风三月花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6478,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瑶华洞仙女诗","author":"无名氏","text":"天葩小院敞银屏，鹊散天河逗客星。\n欲识别来幽意苦，晚峰长想黛眉青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6479,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和马浩澜游西湖诗","author":"苏小小","text":"此地曾经歌舞来，风流回首即尘埃。\n王孙芳草为谁绿，寒食梨花无主开。\n郎去排云叫阊阖，妾今行雨在阳台。\n衷情诉与辽东鹤，松柏西陵正可哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6480,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花联句","author":"田洙薛涛","text":"韶艳应难挽，芳华信易凋。\n缀阶红尚媚，委地白仍娇。\n坠速如辞树，飞迟似恋条。\n藓铺新蹙绣，草叠巧裁绡。\n丽质愁先殒，香魂痛莫招。\n燕衔归故垒，蝶逐过危桥。\n粘帙将晞露，冲帘乍起飙。\n遇晴犹有态，经雨倍无聊。\n蜂趁低兼絮，鱼吞细杂薸。\n轻盈珠履践，零乱翠钿飘。\n鸟过生愁触，儿嬉最怕摇。\n褪英浮雨涧，残蕊漾风潮。\n积径教童扫，沿流倩水漂。\n媚人沾锦瑟，瀹茗入诗瓢。\n玉貌楼前坠，冰容梦里消。\n芳园曾藉坐，长路或追镳。\n罗扇姬盛瓣，筠篱仆护苗。\n折来随手尽，带处近鬟焦。\n泥涴犹凄惨，缶空更寂寥。\n叶浓阴自厚，蒂密子偏饶。\n岂必分茵溷，宁思上砑硝。\n香馀何吝窃，佩解不须邀。\n冶态宜宫额，痴情妒舞腰。\n妆台休浪拂，留伴可怜宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6481,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花仕女诗 其一","author":"桃花仕女","text":"梳成松髻出帘迟，折得桃花三两枝。\n欲插上头还住手，遍从人问可相宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6482,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花仕女诗 其二","author":"桃花仕女","text":"恹恹欹枕卷纱衾，玉腕斜笼一串金。\n梦里自家搔鬓发，索郎抽落凤凰簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6483,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花仕女诗 其三","author":"桃花仕女","text":"浔阳南上不通潮，却算游程岁日遥。\n明月断魂清霭霭，玉人何处教吹箫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6484,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花仕女诗 其四","author":"桃花仕女","text":"西湖荷叶绿盈盈，露重风多荡漾轻。\n倒折荷枝丝不断，露珠易散似郎情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6485,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花仕女诗 其五","author":"桃花仕女","text":"芙容肌肉绿云鬟，几许幽情欲话难。\n闻说春来倍惆怅，莫教长袖倚栏杆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6486,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶答诗","author":"琵琶亭诗","text":"结绮临春万户空，几番挥泪夕阳中。\n唐环不见新留袜，汉燕犹馀旧守宫。\n别苑秋深黄叶坠，寝园春尽碧苔封。\n自惭不是牛僧孺，也向云阶拜玉容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6487,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"船上歌诗 其一","author":"吴师禹","text":"郎提密网截江围，妾把长杆守钓矶。\n满载舫鱼都换酒，轻烟细雨又空归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6488,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"船上歌诗 其二","author":"吴师禹","text":"蓼香月白醒时稀，潮去潮来自不知。\n除却醉眠无一事，东西南北任风吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6489,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"笺上题诗","author":"吴师禹","text":"世路无媒君莫悲，开阑看取牡丹枝。\n姚黄魏紫俱零落，能得春风有几时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6490,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日寄韩生于玉融","author":"王秋英","text":"朔风振憾似潇湘，满树归鸦噪夕阳。\n不见王孙停驷马，惟闻牧竖唤牛羊。\n荒山野水悲长夜，懒鬓疏容怯冻霜。\n漠漠阴云愁黯黯，几时相对一炉香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6491,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归楚留别梦云","author":"王秋英","text":"两年欢会梦魂中，聚散人间似转蓬。\n岁月无情催去燕，关河有信寄来鸿。\n剑沉延浦光终合，瑟鼓湘灵调自工。\n他日扁舟寻旧约，夕阳疏影楚云东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6492,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壁间诗","author":"梁山老人","text":"青青千里草，隐隐独家村。\n日暮客投宿，山深虎守门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6493,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠诗","author":"梁山老人","text":"自有安车自不知，劳劳奔走欲何为？\n回头打紧修工课，似我南山种豆时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6494,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙上鬼诗","author":"无名氏","text":"长风吹浪海天昏，兄弟同时吊屈原。\n千古不消鱼腹恨，一门谁识雁行冤。\n红妆少妇空临镜，白发慈亲尚倚门。\n肠断不堪回首处，一轮明月照双魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6495,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墓鬼诗","author":"无名氏","text":"墓头古树号秋风，墓底幽人万虑空。\n独有诗魂消不得，夜深来访竹溪翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6496,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永福溪鬼诗","author":"无名氏","text":"随波逐浪滞孤魂，白骨沈沙漾水痕。\n几寸柔肠鱼啮断，不关今夜听啼猿。\n饥乌送我棠梨道，雨打风吹梨花老。\n寒食何人奠一卮，髑髅载土生春草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6497,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续鬼诗","author":"无名氏","text":"庭前两株松，风吹一株折。\n朝减半庭阴，夜灭半庭月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6498,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花神诗春愁曲","author":"无名氏","text":"老莺巧妇送春愁，几度留春更不留。\n昨日漫天吹柳絮，玉人从此懒登楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6499,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉海诗 其一","author":"彻鉴堂","text":"才从下里盼中阳，忽踏晶亭看海棠。\n百子峰头飞凤鹤，九星河里浴鸳鸯。\n十天露洒人千劫，万殿香飘玉一床。\n握手紫仪倾珀水，红云袅袅沸笙簧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6500,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉海诗 其二","author":"彻鉴堂","text":"月满中霄永不斜，洪□万亿总黄麻。\n传珰何日飞神女，炼石今朝挹圣娲。\n厘蕊青蒸三籁雨，彤花缝散九明霞。\n武陵莫羡春如锦，例到真官玉海赊。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6501,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]